{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09154","headline":"始除尚书郎别善福精舍 · 韦应物","name":"始除尚书郎别善福精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"简略非世器，委身同草木。\n逍遥精舍居，饮酒自爲足。\n累日曾一栉，对书常懒读。\n社腊会高年，山川恣游瞩。\n明世方选士，中朝悬美禄。\n除书忽到门，冠带便拘束。\n愧忝郎署迹，谬蒙君子录。\n俯仰垂华缨，飘颻翔轻毂。\n行将亲爱别，恋此西涧曲。\n远峰明夕川，夏雨生衆绿。\n迅风飘野路，廻首不遑宿。\n明晨下烟阁，白云在幽谷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}